{{!-- An author, at the foot of a story. Called from inside
      {{#foreach authors}}, so the context is the author.

      With no profile image the box carries the author's initials.
      The initial is cut from the name by CSS rather than by a helper,
      so there is never a broken image and never an empty square.

      CSS and not the split helper, on purpose. split does not exist in
      Ghost 5, and a missing helper there is not a blank space: it is a
      hard 400 on every story and every author page. --}}

<div class="lc-authorcard">
    <span class="lc-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
        {{#if profile_image}}
            <img src="{{img_url profile_image size="xs"}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        {{else}}
            <i>{{name}}</i>
        {{/if}}
    </span>
    <div>
        <div class="lc-nm">{{name}}</div>
        {{#if bio}}<p class="lc-bio">{{bio}}</p>{{/if}}
        <a class="lc-arch" href="{{url}}">All stories by {{name}}</a>
    </div>
</div>
